From c25e9c26c7998a8402250028c43b5ee6656da04c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <a@b.c>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 03:44:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: analysis ids in UI, real cascade on account deletion,
 runtime-editable config constants
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- show analysis number (№) in history, result page, queue, recent lists, upload flash; search history by number
- delete_user_account now explicitly removes analyses, embeddings, chats, messages and files
  (SQLite does not run ON DELETE CASCADE without PRAGMA foreign_keys); flask purge-orphans cleans old leftovers
- /panel/settings/: all config.py constants (except secrets, paths, logging, SQLite timeout) are editable
  by head admin and applied without restart; flask reset-settings as a safety net
